{"id":"vod_bf_19224","vodId":"19224","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"狼与香辛料第二季","name_cn":"狼与香辛料第二季","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-20/54971019b826d45874d34ade8b52d81b.jpg"},"summary":"经验丰富稳重可靠的贤狼赫萝（小清水亚美 配音）遇见了孤身一人独自旅行的商人罗伦斯（福山润 配音），两人结为了旅伴，携手踏上充满了未知的旅程。某日，他们从教会都市出发，前往赫萝的故乡约伊兹。途中，两人来到了正在举行着盛大祭奠的城市库梅尔森，一位名叫阿马堤（千叶纱子 配音）出现在了他们的身边。　　阿马堤是一位善良热心的鱼商人，他被赫萝的活力与自信深深吸引，情不自禁坠入了情网。而罗伦斯的内心里对于赫萝也产生了微妙的感情，看着阿马堤对赫萝的热烈攻势，罗伦斯的心中不知是什么滋味，而他同赫萝也似乎陷入了一个误会之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 00:07:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/langyuxiangxinliaodi